  m_text: Mugiwara's joystick works like a slingshot. After focusing for 2 seconds
    in the opposite direction of the pull, it launches while growing and unaffected
    by cages. If it hits anything, it returns to its starting position and size.
    If the object hit is the ball, it returns with the ball.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
