      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mugiwara\u2019n\u0131n joysticki sapan mant\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r.
    \xC7ekildi\u011Fi y\xF6n\xFCn tersi y\xF6ne do\u011Fru 2 saniye odakland\u0131ktan
    sonra, kafeslerden etkilenmeden ve b\xFCy\xFCyerek f\u0131rlar. Herhangi bir
    \u015Feye \xE7arparsa ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 konumuna ve ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7
    boyutunda d\xF6ner. E\u011Fer \xE7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131 obje top ise, topla
    birlikte d\xF6ner."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
